{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45102","headline":"晦夜李侍御萼宅集招潘述汤衡海上人饮茶赋 · 皎然","name":"晦夜李侍御萼宅集招潘述汤衡海上人饮茶赋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晦夜不生月，琴轩犹爲开。\n墙东隐者在，淇上逸僧来。\n茗爱传花饮，诗看卷素裁。\n风流高此会，晓景屡裴回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45102.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45102","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}